          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi ugira cumi na kane w’ukwezi kwa mbere, muzogire umusi mukuru wa Pasika, bizomara imisi indwi, iyo muzomara murya imikate itarimwo umwambiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri uwo musi umwami azotange impfizi ibe ikimazi gitangiwe ivyaha, acitangire we ubwiwe, hamwe n’abo mu gihugu ciwe bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi wose muri iyo misi indwi y’imisi mikuru, azotange amashuri indwi n’amapfizi y’intama indwi atagira agasembwa, ashikanirwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nk’ibimazi bituriwe, hamwe n’impfizi y’impene y’ikimazi gitangiwe ivyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azotange ingero efa y’ishikanwa ry’ifu rijana n’ishuri yose, hamwe n’iyindi imwe ijana n’impfizi y’intama, kandi efa imwe izojane n’ingero yitwa hini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
