              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri iyo ndwi y’imisi mikuru, itangura ku musi w’icumi na kane w’ukwezi kw’indwi, azotange ibingana bityo ku mashikanwa atangirwa ivyaha, ku mashikanwa yo guturirwa, ku mashikanwa y’ifu, no ku mavuta ya elayo.”",
          "type": "text",
